flowchart TD
  Client[React Client] --> API[Purchase API / 202 Processing]
  API --> Redis[(Redis Rate Limiter)]
  API --> Queue[(Durable PostgreSQL FIFO Attempts)]
  Queue --> Worker[Single Logical Inventory + Order Worker]
  Worker --> DB[(One Transaction: Inventory + Orders)]
  Worker --> Events[(Durable Order Status Event)]
  Events -->|post-commit NOTIFY| WS[WebSocket API]
  WS -->|snapshot + final result| Client
  Edge[Production CDN / WAF / Gateway / Auth] -.-> API
